:: Head's Office
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

<<if Time.schoolDay and $schoolstate isnot "early" and $schoolstate isnot "late" and $pillory.tenant.special.name isnot "Leighton">>

	<<npc Leighton>><<person1>>
	당신은 <<nnpc_title "Leighton">>의 사무실 문을 두드린다. 문 너머에서 <<his>> 목소리가 들린다. "들어와라."
	<br><br>

	<<if $worn.upper.type.includes("school") and $worn.lower.type.includes("school") and !pcAreArmsBound("any") and !$worn.feet.type.includes("shackle") or Time.hour gte 14>>
		<<if $daily.school.headInterrupted isnot 1>>
			당신이 들어가자 레이튼이 책상에서 고개를 든다. "무슨 일이지?"
			<br><br>

			<<if $headdrive is 1 and $headnodetention isnot 1 and $headmoney isnot 1 and $headphotoshoot isnot 1>>
				<<techicon "usb">><<link [[협박한다|Head's Office Blackmail]]>><</link>><<crime "coercion">>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $schoolfameblackmail gte 1>>
				<<if $schoolfameboard is 1>>
					<<if $schoolfameconsensual is 1>>
						<<photographystudioicon>><<link [[사진 촬영 (0:20)|Head's Office Photoshoot]]>><<set $schoolfameblackmail to 0>><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 4) and $schoolfameblackmail gte 3>>
						<<photographystudioicon>><<link [[돈을 받고 사진 촬영을 하겠다고 제안한다|Head's Office Photoshoot Offer]]>><<set $schoolfameblackmail to 0>><<set $schoolfameconsensual to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist4>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					<<photographystudioicon>><<link [[사진 촬영 (0:20)|Head's Office Photoshoot Blackmail]]>><<set $schoolfameblackmail to 0>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<npcincr Leighton dom 1>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<getouticon>><<link [[사무실을 나간다 (0:01)|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<pass 1>><<set $daily.school.headInterrupted to 1>><</link>>

		<<else>>
			<<if $exposed gte 1>>
				<<fameexhibitionism 1>>
			<</if>>

			<<if $headnodetention isnot 1>>
